==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|temptacion|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|temptatio|lang=la}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-temptation.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The act of [[tempting]]
# The condition of being [[tempt]]ed.
# Something [[attractive]], tempting or [[seductive]]; an [[inducement]] or [[enticement]].
# Pressure applied to your [[thinking]] designed to create wrong [[emotions]] which will eventually lead to wrong [[actions]].

====Derived terms====
* [[temptationless]]

